# DUNE EXPRESS: thrown dynamite blows up on a wall and takes armor with it; a
# thrown goose draws a guard's only shot; carrying a goose you fall slowly.
game dune
wait 5
cheat mission 8
cheat pos 29 6
cheat face 1
hold DOWN
press B
release DOWN
wait 2
expect carry == 4
press B
wait 60
expect tile325 == 0
expect alive == 1
cheat mission 5
cheat pos 4 6
cheat face 1
hold DOWN
press B
release DOWN
wait 2
expect carry == 5
cheat pos 7 6
wait 2
press B
wait 40
expect law0_armed == 0
expect alive == 1
